Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 19:17:46 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] crt-emu: panel language from install.ini, //@lang
 metadata blocks

The F12 panel reads lang= from install.ini next to the shader (crt-emu-setup
writes it): en by default, ru. Shader metadata comes in "//@lang|xx" blocks;
the panel keeps the block of its language, else en, else the first block.
Records before the first "//@lang" count for every language, so shaders
without blocks read as before. The panel's own buttons and messages come
from an EN/RU table. CRTEMU_OSD_TEST builds get getters for a host check of
what the panel shows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015yjP4pBYqkzwik2NkFF1dK
